{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01ERBr1KUH2SfpZ3EAzE3SU8", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Brown_(critical_theory)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Yancey_Brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_P._Brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://news.uchicago.edu/profile/bill-brown?page=0\"}, {\"url\": \"https://tableau.uchicago.edu/content/bill-brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://tableau.uchicago.edu/node/6438\"}, {\"url\": \"https://tableau.uchicago.edu/node/11173\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ece.ncsu.edu/?p=224167\"}, {\"url\": \"https://scholars.duke.edu/person/bill.brown\"}, {\"url\": \"https://acceleratelearning.stanford.edu/story/stanford-education-professor-bryan-a-brown-appointed-to-endowed-chair/\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:35:28.907Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Bill Brown Karla Scherer professor \"B.A.\" Duke \"Johns Hopkins\" Stanford", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01HcQnXH32wtEWqtV5PkhpNd", "content": [{"title": "Bill Brown (critical theory)", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bill_Brown_(critical_theory)"}, {"title": "William Yancey Brown", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Yancey_Brown"}, {"title": "William P. Brown", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_P._Brown"}, {"title": "Bill Brown", "url": "https://news.uchicago.edu/profile/bill-brown?page=0"}, {"title": "Bill Brown", "url": "https://tableau.uchicago.edu/content/bill-brown"}, {"title": "Bill Brown", "url": "https://tableau.uchicago.edu/node/6438"}, {"title": "Bill Brown", "url": "https://tableau.uchicago.edu/node/11173"}, {"title": "April S. Brown", "url": "https://ece.ncsu.edu/?p=224167"}, {"title": "scholars.duke.edu", "url": "https://scholars.duke.edu/person/bill.brown"}, {"title": "Tuesday, February 13th 2024 Announcements, Equity in Learning", "url": "https://acceleratelearning.stanford.edu/story/stanford-education-professor-bryan-a-brown-appointed-to-endowed-chair/"}]}, "The search found a clear match for the professorship but not the degree history the query asked about.\n\n- **Bill Brown (UChicago):** Wikipedia describes him as the Karla Scherer distinguished service professor in American culture at the University of Chicago. The UChicago news profile lists his education as PhD, Stanford University.\n- **B.A., Duke, Johns Hopkins:** Nothing in the results ties these to this Bill Brown. The Johns Hopkins and Duke hits belong to other people, such as William Yancey Brown, whose record includes a Johns Hopkins MAT, and a Duke Law professor named Bill Brown whose listing shows only current appointments.\n- **Karla Scherer:** The results treat this as a named professorship and center, not a person's biography, so I found no education details for her.\n\nThe Stanford PhD is the only degree confirmed for the UChicago Bill Brown. The B.A., Duke, and Johns Hopkins parts of the query are unverified."], "durationSeconds": 7.366965958000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01ERBr1KUH2SfpZ3EAzE3SU8", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
